Third-party material
--------------------

The search ranking in src/rummage/search.py (per-modality z-scored similarity, the meaning gate, the word-coverage
bonus and the lookup weighting) is adapted from DigUp's Searcher (https://github.com/ARahim3/DigUp), and the choice
of a GPU llama.cpp build in src/rummage/backends.py (used only when a quick check finds it faster and giving the same
vectors) follows DigUp's setup check, and the audio windows, keyframe sampling, frame sizing and key-file list in
src/rummage/media.py and src/rummage/sources/folder.py are adapted from DigUp's extractors and rules, all under the
